# Build context hygiene. adb/ is excluded on purpose: the image fetches its own native
# platform-tools binary during the build (see Dockerfile), and a local `python setup.py`
# would otherwise drag a host binary of the wrong platform into the image.
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.qwen
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
adb/
banner.PNG
nohup.out
*.log
